{
  "esm": "1.2.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "scale-county-timeagg-year-evap-species-runspec",
    "description": "PLAN.md §7.3.75, step 7f. `scale-county-timeagg-year-evap-species`: the Year twin of `scale-county-evap-species` -- its selections unchanged (every `pollutantProcessAssoc` pair at evaporative permeation, venting and leaks and refueling displacement and spillage), under `scale-county-timeagg-processes-year`'s collapse: January, April, July and October 2020, both day types, all 24 hours, source types 21 and 62, `inputs/washtenaw-county-timeagg.esm`, `<aggregateBy key=\"Year\"/>` and `<outputtimestep value=\"Year\"/>`. MOVESOutput is 22,950 rows.\n\nWHAT IT DISCRIMINATES is PreAggYEAR.sql under the species of the evaporative and refueling processes: the summed FuelSupply shares that AirToxicsCalculator's `ATRatioNonGas` and `minorHAPRatio` weightings and HCSpeciationCalculator's fuel-subtype weighting read (PLAN.md §7.3.69, §7.3.75), over THC that §7.3.68 already reproduces. Permeation has no row, as at every aggregation (PLAN.md §7.3.64): the capture checks every species of it ABSENT.\n\n`n_aggregatesMonths` is 1 and `db_aggregationmonth` the RunSpec's months (`tools/runspec-month-selection.py`). `n_outputRate` is bound to 22950, the (pollutant-process, cohort) pairs of the one (county, month, day) cell, recomputed as `rateSurvivorCount`.\n\n`db_movesoutput` is DECLARED AND CONSUMED BY NOTHING, as in every RunSpec here.",
    "authors": [
      "EarthSciML Authors and Contributors"
    ],
    "tags": [
      "fixture",
      "onroad",
      "default-database",
      "single-county-domain",
      "road-type-axis",
      "evaporative",
      "refueling",
      "air-toxics",
      "hc-speciation",
      "nonhaptog",
      "mechanism",
      "time-aggregation",
      "output-time-step",
      "year-aggregation"
    ]
  },
