          "output-time-step"
        ],
        "note": "The 22,950-row expected output at `<outputtimestep value=\"Year\"/>`, monthID, dayID and hourID NULL, the one Whole Year cell scaled by its 365/7 weeks; the model emits it from `mos_*`. Venting, leaks, refueling displacement and spillage on all five road types; NO permeation row of any species (no cold-soak tank temperature under the collapse); NonHAPTOG at all four, the mechanism nowhere, naphthalene gas at spillage alone, methane at 18 and 19.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
